{"id":41,"titleZh":"永远的贝多芬","titleEn":"Forever Beethoven","date":"1968-01-28","dateZh":"1968 年 1 月 28 日","concepts":"意外转折、受制约的自由、十二年四稿修改","thesis":"贝多芬解放音乐靠的不是想弹什么就弹什么，而是克制淘汰掉无数常见套路后，在关键小节果断换上那个出人意料的音。","plain":"为什么过了百年多，从日常音乐厅到甲壳虫乐队电影还总能听到贝多芬？伯恩斯坦给出回答：自由从来不是毫无边界，挑选一个就意味着放弃其他十一个。贝多芬的过人之处，在于打破平庸的可预测性，并为关键的一拍反复打磨十余年。","scenes":["用《英雄交响曲》开头四小节作实验：前四小节老实沿着三和弦爬升，到了第五小节突然向下落进意外的“降 D 音”，伯恩斯坦点出正是这个精确的转折打破了常规套路。","安排青年以色列钢琴家卡利希斯坦与出生在阿尔及利亚的法国指挥卡波隆戈携手演奏《第四钢琴协奏曲》，随后演完历时十二年写出四稿序曲的《莱奥诺拉第三序曲》。"],"category":"大师与杰作","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1eA411Y7jU","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eA411Y7jU","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 永远的贝多芬","duration":"51:26","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/forever-beethoven","repertoire":[{"composer":"Beethoven","piece":"Symphony No. 5 in C Minor, Op. 67 (1st Movement)","titleZh":"第五交响曲第一乐章","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/52/93/02/52930254-6025-c7d2-92cb-44f34e24c22d/mzaf_2193174951270121243.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/symphony-no-5-in-c-minor-op-67-orch-by-gustav-mahler/1743941872?i=1743941874&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Deutsche Staatsphilharmonie Rheinland-Pfalz & Michael Francis","recordingTrack":"Symphony No. 5 in C Minor, Op. 67 (Orch. by Gustav Mahler): II. Andante con moto","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Beethoven%20Symphony%20No.%205%20in%20C%20Minor%2C%20Op.%2067+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Beethoven%20Symphony%20No.%205%20in%20C%20Minor%2C%20Op.%2067"},{"composer":"Beethoven","piece":"Piano Concerto No. 4 in G Major, Op. 58 (2nd & 3rd Mvts)","titleZh":"第四钢琴协奏曲第二、三乐章","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Beethoven%20Piano%20Concerto%20No.%204%20in%20G%20Major%2C%20Op.%2058+Bernstein","biliSe